 "not_published": "the answer bodies (their sha256 are listed); they are kept with the run",
 "caveats": [
  "36 questions and one run on each side: the 95% intervals of the 5 November run and this run overlap on every row and do not separate the two runs.",
  "v1.2 was first published on 2026-11-13 (commit 09094bf8), before this run and after the 5 November run. v1.2 changed the expected schema of Q1-06..Q1-11 from /4 to /5 after /5 answers had been seen, so passes of those six questions on v1.2 are not independent evidence.",
  "This run does not isolate the effect of any service release between 5 November and this run.",
